    - target: {fileID: 2625978853664738727, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: 'Still Standing You are still here. That is more than most could say.
        Something pulled you to this dungeon. Something is pulling you further still.
        The Weaver''s trail does not end here. It goes deeper. It gets darker. You
        are the Fool. You were never supposed to make it this far. Keep going anyway. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2713550664584638487, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
