    - target: {fileID: 5279213525990488120, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Still Standing

        You are still here.

        That is more than
        most could say.

        Something pulled you to this dungeon.

        Something
        is pulling you further still.

        The Weaver''s trail does not end here.

        It
        goes deeper.

        It gets darker.

        You are the Fool.

        You
        were never supposed to make it this far.

        Keep going anyway.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
